PostgreSQL
    │
    │ Port 5432
    │
    ▼
EC2 Host
    │
    │ host.docker.internal
    │
    ▼
Docker Network: microservices-net
    │
    ├── catalog-service       :8082
    ├── inventory-service     :8083
    ├── notification-service
    ├── auth-service
    ├── order-service
    ├── payment-service
    ├── analytics-service
    │
    └── frontend

The critical point is:

PostgreSQL = EC2 HOST
Microservices = Docker containers

Therefore, containers must not use:

127.0.0.1:5432

They must use:

host.docker.internal:5432
STEP 1 — Go to the project
cd ~/7-Microservice-Project

Verify:

pwd

Expected:

