Your PostgreSQL is installed directly on Ubuntu/EC2.

Start it:

sudo systemctl start postgresql

Check status:

sudo systemctl status postgresql

You want:

Active: active

active (exited) can be normal for the Debian/Ubuntu PostgreSQL wrapper service; the actual PostgreSQL cluster can still be running.

