STEP 15 — Find the remaining 5 services

Before starting them, do not guess their database variables.

Run:

grep -R -n -E \
"127.0.0.1:5432|localhost.*5432|process.env|DB_URL|DB_DSN|DATABASE_URL" \
services/ 2>/dev/null

This identifies the exact database configuration for:

notification-service
auth-service
order-service
payment-service
analytics-service

For every service, determine:

1. Image name
2. Container name
3. Application port
4. Database name
5. Environment variable
6. Database URL format

